  clock: 3  # be81
  nonce: be81  # be81
  message: "I guess it does not need to be a hard gate but the agent must be warned against trying to juggle too many tasks concurrently that are very often interdependent and whose sequence can easily get jumbled due to unpredictable network conditions."  # be81
- op: update  # d2d7
  at: '2026-03-05T21:11:38Z'  # d2d7
  by: human  # d2d7
